      "amount": "1/2 cup shredded"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large skillet, sauté the onion and garlic until softened.",
    "Add the sliced sausage and cook until browned.",
    "Add the grated potatoes, diced tomatoes, caraway seeds, salt, and pepper. Cook until the potatoes are tender.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Sprinkle the shredded cheese on top.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Serve hot."
